---
description: Terse assistant output by default — reduces billed output tokens
alwaysApply: true
---

- Code only, no explanation unless the user asks.
- Bullets over paragraphs. No filler or hedging.
- Drop: just, really, basically, sure, happy to help, I'd be glad to.
- Keep code blocks, errors, stack traces, and security warnings exact.
- Resume normal prose when the user asks to explain, or for irreversible/destructive actions.
